{"id":"3a9f1c3bbe45ef77","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-posts-theorem.md","title":"Post's Theorem","display":"thm-posts-theorem — Post's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-posts-theorem","aliases":["68-thm-posts-theorem"],"display":"thm-posts-theorem — Post's Theorem","depends_on":["[[68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set]]","[[68-df-turing-reducibility]]","[[68-df-turing-jump]]","[[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","[[68-df-recursive-set]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§14.8-14.9 pp.52-53 and §16.1 p.59 / PDF 61-62,68","verification_status":"source-adapted-theorem","source_proof_status":"source-proof-and-adaptation-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-posts-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-posts-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-posts-theorem — Post's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a48deec92f1ddb01\" href=\"?note=a48deec92f1ddb01\" title=\"68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ed23faee951231d\" href=\"?note=7ed23faee951231d\" title=\"68-df-turing-reducibility\">68-df-turing-reducibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36459bc8c6a3f6a6\" href=\"?note=36459bc8c6a3f6a6\" title=\"68-df-turing-jump\">68-df-turing-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e61d0905238a638\" href=\"?note=5e61d0905238a638\" title=\"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7fc8baae87b873a3\" href=\"?note=7fc8baae87b873a3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-set\">68-df-recursive-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§14.8-14.9 pp.52-53 and §16.1 p.59 / PDF 61-62,68"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-theorem"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-and-adaptation-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}^B,\\leq_T,B&#39;,\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}^B,\\leq_T,B&#39;,\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0\\)</span> 见所列直接依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset^{(n)}\">\\(\\emptyset^{(n)}\\)</span> 在下式按 n 递归定义，是集合而非度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset^{(0)}:=\\emptyset,\\qquad\\emptyset^{(n+1)}:=(\\emptyset^{(n)})&#39;.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\emptyset^{(0)}:=\\emptyset,\\qquad\\emptyset^{(n+1)}:=(\\emptyset^{(n)})&#39;.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{RE}^{\\emptyset^{(n)}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{RE}^{\\emptyset^{(n)}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Pi_{n+1}^0\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\in\\mathrm{RE}^{\\emptyset^{(n)}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\Pi_{n+1}^0\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\in\\mathrm{RE}^{\\emptyset^{(n)}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta_{n+1}^0\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\leq_T\\emptyset^{(n)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\Delta_{n+1}^0\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\leq_T\\emptyset^{(n)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 14.8、14.9，印刷 pp.52–53 / PDF pp.61–62，表述为 Σ_(n+1) 是“RE in Π_n”、Δ_(n+1) 是“recursive in Π_n”。16.1，印刷 p.59 / PDF p.68，给出 Π_n/Σ_n 完全集的度为 0 的 n 次跳跃，因此可把整类 oracle 换成单个空集 n 次跳跃。n=0 是 RE=Σ_1 与两侧都 RE 当且仅当递归的基础情形。这里保留目录原有单跳跃表述，并补齐迭代的集合定义；不能只在 Remark 中默认这一递归约定。已核对 14.8–14.9 的证明和 16.1 的归纳论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"a48deec92f1ddb01","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-reducibility","status":"resolved","id":"7ed23faee951231d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-reducibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-jump","status":"resolved","id":"36459bc8c6a3f6a6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"5e61d0905238a638","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"7fc8baae87b873a3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-set]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}^B,\\leq_T,B',\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\emptyset^{(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\emptyset^{(0)}:=\\emptyset,\\qquad\\emptyset^{(n+1)}:=(\\emptyset^{(n)})'.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\in\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{RE}^{\\emptyset^{(n)}}.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\in\\Pi_{n+1}^0\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\in\\mathrm{RE}^{\\emptyset^{(n)}}.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\in\\Delta_{n+1}^0\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\leq_T\\emptyset^{(n)}.","display":true}],"bytes":1761,"backlinks":[{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-posts-theorem]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"相对计算与度：[[68-df-oracle-computation]] → [[68-df-turing-reducibility]] → [[68-df-turing-degree]]；[[68-df-turing-jump]]、[[68-thm-posts-theorem]]、[[68-thm-friedberg-muchnik-theorem]]。"}],"outgoing":["a48deec92f1ddb01","7ed23faee951231d","36459bc8c6a3f6a6","5e61d0905238a638","7fc8baae87b873a3"]}